Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?deps=5Fguard:=20whitelist=20libcamera=5Fhos?=
 =?UTF-8?q?t=5Fvdi=5Fimpl=E2=86=92libhybris-common?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The N12.D droidmedia pivot (see
device/board/oniro/docs/hybris_generic/phase_n12_camera_droidmedia.md)
links libcamera_host_vdi_impl_1.0.z.so against libhybris-common so
it can hybris_dlopen /android/system/lib64/libdroidmedia.so.
libhybris lives under system/lib64 (chipset-sdk-restricted), so
this dependency requires a deps_guard entry to pass the
inter-partition-deps build check.

Change-Id: I65c673242197f6967128b23efcdf6639ac7b93cd
Signed-off-by: Francesco Pham <francesco.pham1@h-partners.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0a2b84ec0e10bcb235e3e5fa62ec67c5126a5b34)
---
 tools/deps_guard/rules/chipsetsdk_dep_whitelist.json | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/deps_guard/rules/chipsetsdk_dep_whitelist.json b/tools/deps_guard/rules/chipsetsdk_dep_whitelist.json
index 7939ca7..8b532e5 100644
--- a/tools/deps_guard/rules/chipsetsdk_dep_whitelist.json
+++ b/tools/deps_guard/rules/chipsetsdk_dep_whitelist.json
@@ -4808,6 +4808,13 @@
         "dep_file_path": "system/lib64/chipset-sdk/libhilog.so",
         "description": "hybris_generic: libdisplay_composer_vdi_impl.z.so (passthrough) depends on libhilog (chipsetsdk)"
     },
+    {
+        "so_file_name": "libcamera_host_vdi_impl_1.0.z.so",
+        "so_file_path": "vendor/lib64/libcamera_host_vdi_impl_1.0.z.so",
+        "dep_file_name": "libhybris-common.z.so",
+        "dep_file_path": "system/lib64/libhybris/libhybris-common.z.so",
+        "description": "hybris_generic: libcamera_host_vdi_impl_1.0.z.so depends on libhybris-common (system-only) — N12.D droidmedia pivot uses libhybris to dlopen /android/system/lib64/libdroidmedia.so"
+    },
     {
         "so_file_name": "libmemory_tracker_interface_service_1.0.z.so",
         "so_file_path": "vendor/lib/passthrough/libmemory_tracker_interface_service_1.0.z.so",
-- 
